        "region_id": "algorithm-and-prop31",
        "source_URL": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.06905v1#S3.SS2.p4.1",
        "source_id": "S3.SS2.p4.1",
        "source_tag": "p",
        "text": "To further reduce the bounce rate and the resulting computational cost, we introduce a conditional reference point and use the smoothness of $V$ to control the local gradient difference. Specifically, draw $\\widetilde{X}\\sim\\pi_{\\eta}^{X\\mid Y=y}$ independently and write the exact decomposition",
