        "text": "The harmonic and residual terms sum to the full conditional force $\\sqrt{\\eta}\\,\\nabla V_{y}(x)$ . Thus $\\widetilde{x}$ changes only how this force is divided between deterministic motion and bounces. By the $\\beta$ -smoothness of $V$ ,",
